{
 "_about": [
  "Input for the daylight-saving harness. Read by scripts/dst-harness/run.mjs (web tuner engine) and",
  "Nostalgex/NostalgexTests/DSTHarnessTests.swift (Apple TV engine). Both simulate a device that is on every",
  "day from three days before a clock change to two days after, then sample what each surface says is on",
  "every five minutes from the day before the change to the end of the day after it.",
  "channels: small = whole pool shorter than a day (filler all day), medium = about 35 h, big = about 115 h",
  "(unplayed-first never runs out, so a title from yesterday should never air today).",
  "scenarios: change = the local date of a clock change. Controls have no daylight saving; they run on the",
  "same dates as the US and EU changes so they can be compared with them."
